.fac/
# .docs/ is local-only working material (sprints, refs, notes) — except the
# XFAIL debt ledger, Sprint 60/61 audit ledgers and closeouts, which CI
# cross-checks, and HANDOFF.md, which is worthless if it does not survive a
# fresh clone. The `/*` form (not `/`) lets the negation work.
.docs/*
!.docs/HANDOFF.md
!.docs/warnings-matrix.md
!.docs/audits
.docs/audits/*
!.docs/audits/audit-*.md
!.docs/audits/burndown.md
!.docs/audits/closeout-*.md
!.docs/audits/xfail-debt.md
!.docs/audits/afsld-elf-debt.md
!.docs/audits/debug-info-debt.md
!.docs/audits/tls-debt.md
!.docs/audits/abi-debt.md
!.docs/audits/afs-as-pic-debt.md
!.docs/audits/freebsd-vm.md
!.docs/audits/packed-layout.md
!.docs/audits/aligned-layout.md
!.docs/audits/torture-triage.md
!.docs/audits/bootstrap-soak.md
!.docs/design
.docs/design/*
!.docs/design/determinism.md
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
build/
build-san/
build-clang/
*.o
*.a
